{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_064AE0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"博士。我觉得你对核武器的感情，和其他研究人员似乎有些不同。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"为什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"听了你刚才和Coldman的对话，就会这么觉得。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":58,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"……我说过我父亲参与过曼哈顿计划吧。你了解那个计划吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"知道个大概。就是开启核时代序幕的计划。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"没错。那是一个汇集了众多诺贝尔奖得主等20世纪顶尖头脑、耗资约20亿美元——还是按1940年代币值计算——的巨大计划。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":161,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"这个计划在1945年7月16日，以阿拉莫戈多的原子弹试验成功告终。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":85,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"以及半个月后紧接着的实战使用。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"博士？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"……我不能走路。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"嗯？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"我从出生起就不能走路。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"这和你父亲参与那个计划有什么关系？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"我父亲在研究过程中遭受了相当剂量的辐射。我认为我的染色体异常……和这件事并非毫无关系。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":129,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"……我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"嗯？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"正因为如此，我不想让核武器只是一把达摩克利斯之剑。我想让它作为战争的威慑力量，拥有明确的存在意义。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":147,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"……博士。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"必须阻止他，阻止Coldman。无论如何都要。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":55,"review_flag":""}]}